>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"photo-grid\">\n      <div class=\"photo-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[照片：机场安检口，人们排队通过安全检查通道]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">人们排队进行安全检查</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[照片：纺纱车间，工人正在操作纺织机器]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">纺纱工人按操作规程工作</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[照片：城市十字路口俯视图，行人、自行车、机动车各行其道]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">行人、自行车、机动车各行其道</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[照片：公共场所内，墙上贴有\"静\"及\"请勿大声喧哗\"标语]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">人们在公共场所保持安静</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"questions\">\n      <div class=\"question-line\">\n        <span class=\"arrow\">◆</span>\n        <span class=\"q-text\">以上图片体现了哪些方面的社会秩序？<span class=\"answer\">社会管理秩序、生产秩序、交通秩序、公共场所秩序</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line\">\n        <span class=\"arrow\">◆</span>\n        <span class=\"q-text\">如果没有秩序，我们的生活将会怎样？<span class=\"answer\">将会陷入无序化状态，混乱不堪。社会将不能正常运转，人民将不能安居乐业。</span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    22 &nbsp; 第二单元 &nbsp; 遵守社会规则\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">统编版</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
